         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.43</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.43 removes dynamic third-party source loaders. SyQon and AutoDBE automation are temporarily unavailable pending a supported secure execution path.</li>
               <li>Native process choices remain available. Saved script selections and icon overrides cannot bypass the restriction.</li>
               <li>Direct PCC server settings require HTTPS. SPFC setup explains the default installed filters.xspd library.</li>
               <li>Security, network and storage disclosure is available in the project documentation. Dependency review and PTeam clarification remain open.</li>
               <li>All 22 regression scripts and isolated native settings, setup-dialog and synthetic histogram checks passed.</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
